{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-marlin-reportage","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"marlin-reportage-reportage-properties-al-reem-island","about":"Marlin Reportage is a symbol of modern luxury and sophisticated style, presented in the form of a premium residential complex. Consisting of 18 floors, it offers a variety of accommodation, including studios, apartments with a different number of bedrooms and spacious penthouses, each of which is distinguished by sophistication and elegance.The exterior of the complex attracts attention with its modern design and impeccable architecture, creating an impression of harmony of beauty and functionality. The interiors are permeated with an atmosphere of luxury and comfort, where spacious and bright apartments create coziness and harmony, and modern finishing materials add sophistication.Residents of the complex can enjoy a variety of amenities, including a swimming pool, a fitness center and recreation areas where they can relax and enjoy the atmosphere of comfort and tranquility. Due to its convenient location close to shopping malls, restaurants and entertainment venues, Marlin Reportage becomes an ideal place for a comfortable and stylish life.In addition, there are wonderful attractions near the complex, such as City Park, just a 10-minute walk away, and the Museum of Arts and Science, which can be reached in just 15 minutes. There is also a metro station nearby, which provides convenient transportation around the city.","price":2409971,"title":"Marlin Reportage","bitrix":{"id":838,"pf_id":"are.3.13561","source":null,"project_id":"Shams Abu Dhabi","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Marlin Reportage","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Reportage Properties","project_location":"Al Reem Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/903/images/2024/04/09/340x252/UMQeOwcrNzyZJOTNLOJIQ1gENhr9